1619 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 791 0 R
/E (This study explores the role of Beppe Fenoglio in promoting literary and cultural tourism in the Langhe region \(Piedmont, Italy\). It examines how his works, centered on the rural Langhe and the Italian Resistance, transform the landscape into a space of historical memory, moral reflection, and civic identity, and evaluates the impact of Fenoglio-themed initiatives on tourism development.)
/Pg 54 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1620 0 obj
<<
