/Pg 54 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1622 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 791 0 R
/E (Fenoglio functions as an ethical cultural brand, attracting tourists interested in both landscape and historical memory. He transforms the Langhe into a literary and moral landscape, where contemporary tourism seeks not only wine, views, and UNESCO-recognized landscapes but also sites of Resistance, memory, and peasant life. The integration of literature, history, and tourism contributes to sustainable local development and the preservation of a unique cultural heritage.)
/Pg 54 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
